<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;
The "special false" is dual valued.  You can reproduce it like this:
&lt;code&gt;
$false = '';
$foo = $false + 0;
&lt;/code&gt;
(Which gives a warning.) Now "$false" is exactly the same as "not 1".
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
Or more explicit:
&lt;code&gt;
use Scalar::Util 'dualvar';
$false = dualvar(0, '');
&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
